# High-speed CAN example: send a request and wait for the reply.
#
# OBD mode 01 PID 00 ("supported PIDs") to the engine controller at 7E0; the reply comes
# back on 7E8 starting "?? 41 00". The simulator answers this one, so it can be tried
# with no hardware.

send HS 7E0 02 01 00 00 00 00 00 00
waitfor HS 7E8 ?? 41 00 timeout 1000

wait 250

# Three more, 100 ms apart. "continue" means carry on even if no reply arrives.
repeat 3
    send HS 7E0 02 01 0C 00 00 00 00 00      # PID 0C, engine speed
    waitfor HS 7E8 ?? 41 0C timeout 500 continue
    wait 100
end
